{
  "": "keep: texts the rich editor opens, with what it writes back once edited. source: texts it leaves in Markdown, and why. Checked by internal/web/jstest/richtext.test.mjs and internal/markdown/richtext_corpus_test.go.",
  "keep": [
    {
      "name": "table with alignment, code, emphasis, refs and mentions",
